    "alt_text": "Three-panel graphical abstract showing scaffold-controlled molecular representation benchmark. Panel A compares ECFP4 fingerprints versus learned graph/transformer models under chemical extrapolation. Panel B illustrates workflow from 19,836 antimalarial molecules through random and scaffold splits to five models evaluated by ROC AUC. Panel C shows horizontal bar chart where ECFP4-RF achieves highest ROC AUC (0.8300), statistically outperforming all learned models under scaffold split."
